  "schema:name": "Particularly Valuable and Vulnerable Marine Areas (SVO)",
  "schema:description": "The dataset contains particularly valuable areas identified through the management plans for the Barents Sea and Lofoten, the Norwegian Sea, the North Sea and Skagerrak. Particularly valuable areas include vulnerable habitats, important spawning and nursery areas for fish, important areas for seabirds, the Egga Edge, the polar front, the ice edge and the coastal zone.",
